            { text: "then there will be constructed a certain polyhedral figure inscribed in the sphere and contained by pyramids,",
              highlighted: ["sphGreater"].concat(FACES) },
            { text: "of which the said quadrilaterals and the triangle {URO}, and the others corresponding to them, are the bases",
              highlighted: FACES },
            { text: "and the point {A} is the vertex.",
              highlighted: FACES.concat(APEX).concat(["A"]) },
            { text: "I say that the said polyhedron does not touch the lesser sphere",
              highlighted: FACES.concat(["sphLesser"]) },
            { text: "at the surface on which the circle {FGH} is.",
              highlighted: ["FGH","sphLesser"] },
            { text: "Draw {AX} from the point {A} perpendicular to the plane of the quadrilateral {KBPS},",
              visible: AXs,
              highlighted: ["AX","KBPS"],
              transition: { animations: [
                  { elem: "AX", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect } ] } },
            { text: "and let it meet the plane at the point {X}. Join {XB|BX} and {XK|KX}.",
              highlighted: ["X","BX","KX"],
              transition: { animations: [
                  { elem: "X", name: geomlib.A.Point.appear },
                  { elem: "BX", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect },
                  { elem: "KX", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect } ] },
              justifications: [{ ref: "XI.11" }] },
            { text: "Then, since {AX} is at right angles to the plane of the quadrilateral {KBPS},",
              highlighted: ["AX","KBPS"] },
            { text: "therefore it is also at right angles to all the straight lines",
              highlighted: ["AX"] },
            { text: "which meet it and are in the plane of the quadrilateral.",
              highlighted: ["AX","KBPS"] },
            { text: "Therefore {AX} is at right angles to each of the straight lines {BX} and {XK|KX}.",
              visible: RA,
              highlighted: ["AX","BX","KX"],
              transition: { mode: "parallel", animations: [
                  { elem: "angAXB", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "angAXK", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep } ] },
              justifications: [{ ref: "XI.Def.3" }] },
            { text: "And, since {AB} equals {AK|KA}, therefore the square on {AB} equals the square on {AK|KA}.",
              highlighted: ["AB","KA"] },
            { text: "And the sum of the squares on {AX} and {XB|BX} equals the square on {AB},",
